==Strategy==
Use fast and/or Toxic Immune meatshields like [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]]/[[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]], as well as fast attackers such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to push your way forwards. Eventually, CyberFace will spawn, so be sure to start stacking [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researchers]] before that point to minimize the possibility of bad RNG bricking that attempt, then [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] him when at the right moment. Alternatively, you use a well-timed lvl 46+ [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] to kill CyberFace instantly. Once he's dead, you just have to break past The Face and snatch your victory before the two minute time limit expires.

